<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f0f1f5">
  <title>PhoneCam Link — Small camera. Bigger possibilities.</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Bring your Android phone camera to your Windows PC with PhoneCam Link. Explore the experience and get the apps from GitHub Releases.">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:title" content="PhoneCam Link — Small camera. Bigger possibilities.">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Bring your Android phone camera to your Windows PC with PhoneCam Link. Explore the experience and get the apps from GitHub Releases.">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml;base64,">
  <link rel="preload" as="image" href="data:image/webp;base64," fetchpriority="high">
  <style>@layer reset, base, components, motion, responsive;
@layer reset {
  *,*::before,*::after {
    box-sizing:border-box;
  }
  body,h1,h2,h3,p,figure {
    margin:0;
  }
  button,a {
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;
  }
  button,input {
    font:inherit;
  }
  button {
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  a {
    color:inherit;
    text-decoration:none;
  }
  img {
    display:block;
    max-width:100%;
  }
  button {
    color:inherit;
  }
  svg {
    width:24px;
    height:24px;
    fill:none;
    stroke:currentColor;
    stroke-width:1.5;
    stroke-linecap:round;
    stroke-linejoin:round;
    flex:none;
  }
  button:disabled {
    cursor:default;
  }
}
@layer base {
  :root {
    --paper:#f7f8fc;
    --ink:#191a1c;
    --muted:#77787d;
    --line:#d5d7dd;
    --accent:#a8c1ff;
    --dark:#111217;
    --serif:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;
    --ease:cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);
    --header-height:80px;
    color-scheme:light;
  }
  html {
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
    scroll-padding-top:100px;
  }
  body {
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  ::selection {
    background:var(--accent);
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  :focus-visible {
    outline:3px solid #314685;
    outline-offset:6px;
  }
  h1,h2,h3 {
    font-weight:500;
  }
  h1,h2 {
    letter-spacing:-.065em;
    line-height:1.03;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size:clamp(42px,5.1vw,74px);
  }
  h3 {
    letter-spacing:-.035em;
  }
  .serif {
    font-family:var(--serif);
    font-style:italic;
    font-weight:400;
    letter-spacing:-.065em;
  }
  .muted {
    color:#919297;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size:10px;
    letter-spacing:.17em;
    line-height:1.6;
    font-weight:600;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:9px;
  }
  .section-shell {
    width:min(1184px,calc(100% - 112px));
    margin-inline:auto;
  }
  .body-copy {
    font-size:17px;
    line-height:1.65;
    color:#696b70;
  }
  .status-dot {
    width:6px;
    height:6px;
    display:inline-block;
    background:#3a4f8d;
    border-radius:50%;
    flex:none;
  }
  .svg-definitions {
    position:absolute;
    width:0;
    height:0;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .skip-link {
    position:fixed;
    top:-100px;
    left:12px;
    background:var(--accent);
    padding:14px;
    z-index:100;
  }
  .skip-link:focus {
    top:12px;
  }
  a[aria-disabled=true] {
    opacity:.5;
    cursor:not-allowed;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
}
@layer components {
  .site-header {
    height:var(--header-height);
    position:relative;
    z-index:40;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    padding:0 48px;
    border-bottom:1px solid #dddfe5;
    background:var(--paper);
  }
  .brand {
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    font-size:19px;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:-.7px;
    gap:4px;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .brand-light {
    font-weight:400;
  }
  .brand-mark {
    width:29px;
    height:29px;
    border-radius:9px;
    display:grid;
    place-items:center;
    margin-right:5px;
    background:var(--ink);
    color:var(--paper);
  }
  .brand-mark svg {
    width:20px;
    height:20px;
  }
  .desktop-nav {
    display:flex;
    gap:31px;
    align-items:center;
    font-size:12px;
  }
  .desktop-nav a {
    position:relative;
    padding:12px 0;
  }
  .desktop-nav a::after {
    content:'';
    position:absolute;
    bottom:6px;
    left:0;
    width:100%;
    height:1px;
    background:currentColor;
    transform:scaleX(0);
    transform-origin:left;
    transition:transform .3s;
  }
  .desktop-nav a:hover::after {
    transform:scaleX(1);
  }
  .nav-actions {
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:16px;
  }
  .button {
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:27px;
    padding:17px 22px;
    font-size:12px;
    line-height:1.2;
    border-radius:50px;
    color:var(--paper);
    background:var(--ink);
    border:1px solid transparent;
    transition:transform .3s var(--ease),background .3s;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .button svg,.text-link svg {
    width:17px;
    height:17px;
  }
  .button:hover {
    transform:translateY(-3px);
    background:#34363d;
  }
  .button-small {
    padding:12px 16px;
    font-size:11px;
    gap:15px;
  }
  .button-accent {
    background:var(--accent);
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .button-accent:hover {
    background:#9eb6ff;
  }
  .button-light {
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .button-light:hover {
    background:#fff;
  }
  .text-link {
    display:inline-flex;
    gap:17px;
    align-items:center;
    font-size:12px;
    line-height:1.6;
  }
  .text-link svg,.text-link>span {
    transition:transform .3s;
  }
  .text-link:hover svg {
    transform:translate(3px,-2px);
  }
  .text-link:hover>span {
    transform:translateY(3px);
  }
  .motion-toggle {
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    width:29px;
    height:29px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:transparent;
    display:grid;
    place-items:center;
    font-size:12px;
  }
  .menu-toggle {
    display:none;
    border:0;
    background:transparent;
    width:32px;
    height:32px;
    padding:6px;
  }
  .menu-toggle span {
    height:1px;
    width:20px;
    background:var(--ink);
    display:block;
    margin:5px 0;
  }
  .mobile-nav {
    position:absolute;
    top:64px;
    left:0;
    right:0;
    background:var(--paper);
    padding:20px 24px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .mobile-nav a {
    display:block;
    padding:16px 4px;
    font-size:20px;
  }
  .hero {
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero-copy {
    text-align:center;
    padding-top:68px;
    position:relative;
    z-index:3;
  }
  .hero .eyebrow {
    justify-content:center;
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size:clamp(64px,7.3vw,108px);
    line-height:.98;
  }
  .hero h1 .serif {
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:2px;
  }
  .hero-description {
    font-size:15px;
    line-height:1.65;
    color:#6f7279;
    margin-top:27px;
  }
  .hero-actions {
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:28px;
    align-items:center;
    margin-top:25px;
  }
  .device-stage {
    height:600px;
    position:relative;
    margin-top:12px;
    perspective:1600px;
    --hero-progress:0;
    isolation:isolate;
  }
  .device-rig {
    position:absolute;
    width:920px;
    height:500px;
    left:50%;
    top:45px;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    z-index:3;
  }
  .laptop {
    position:absolute;
    width:710px;
    top:43px;
    left:124px;
    transform:perspective(1700px) rotateY(-9deg) rotateX(5deg) rotateZ(2deg) translateY(calc(var(--hero-progress)*-18px));
    transform-origin:50% 70%;
    will-change:transform;
  }
  .laptop-lid {
    padding:12px 10px 13px;
    border:2px solid #4c4d51;
    border-radius:18px 18px 9px 9px;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#34363b,#0e0f14 60%,#717276);
    position:relative;
    box-shadow:0 1px 0 #9d9fa6 inset,8px 5px 0 #8a8c92,11px 7px 0 #42444a;
  }
  .webcam {
    position:absolute;
    left:50%;
    top:4px;
    width:4px;
    height:4px;
    border:1px solid #4e5055;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:#121b23;
  }
  .laptop-display {
    height:386px;
    border:1px solid #17181d;
    position:relative;
    border-radius:4px;
    overflow:hidden;
    background:#093044;
  }
  .laptop-display::after {
    content:'';
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    background:linear-gradient(120deg,#fff1,transparent 50%);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .laptop-display img {
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    object-fit:cover;
  }
  .screen-topline,.screen-bottomline {
    position:absolute;
    left:20px;
    right:20px;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    font-size:8px;
    letter-spacing:1.5px;
    color:#fff9;
  }
  .screen-topline {
    top:19px;
  }
  .screen-topline>span:first-child {
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:6px;
    font-size:8px;
    color:white;
  }
  .screen-topline i {
    width:4px;
    height:4px;
    background:var(--accent);
    border-radius:50%;
  }
  .screen-bottomline {
    bottom:18px;
    font-size:7px;
  }
  .viewfinder-cross {
    font-size:16px;
  }
  .screen-caption {
    position:absolute;
    left:25px;
    bottom:52px;
    color:white;
    font-family:var(--serif);
    font-style:italic;
    font-size:34px;
    letter-spacing:-1.5px;
  }
  .screen-corner {
    position:absolute;
    width:20px;
    height:20px;
    border:1px solid #fff8;
  }
  .top-left {
    top:65px;
    left:25px;
    border-right:0;
    border-bottom:0;
  }
  .bottom-right {
    bottom:62px;
    right:25px;
    border-left:0;
    border-top:0;
  }
  .laptop-base {
    position:relative;
    width:115%;
    left:-7.5%;
    height:21px;
    background:linear-gradient(#d2d4db 0%,#898c93 35%,#b9bcc4 48%,#50535b 90%);
    border-radius:2px 2px 55% 55% / 2px 2px 80% 80%;
    transform:perspective(100px) rotateX(6deg);
    box-shadow:0 1px 1px #f3f5fd inset;
  }
  .laptop-notch {
    position:absolute;
    left:42%;
    right:42%;
    top:0;
    height:6px;
    border-radius:0 0 7px 7px;
    background:linear-gradient(#767982,#9fa3b1);
  }
  .device-shadow {
    position:absolute;
    z-index:-1;
    bottom:-50px;
    left:0;
    right:0;
    height:65px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:#22242b50;
    filter:blur(27px);
  }
  .phone {
    position:absolute;
    top:103px;
    left:38px;
    width:180px;
    height:358px;
    border:2px solid #8f929d;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#bbbfca,#32353c 12%,#7d808b 55%,#b9bdc8);
    border-radius:28px;
    padding:6px;
    transform:rotate(-11deg) translateY(calc(var(--hero-progress)*-40px));
    box-shadow:-3px 2px 0 #3b3e49,8px 14px 18px #16192335;
    z-index:4;
    will-change:transform;
  }
  .phone-screen {
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
    border:2px solid #0d0f14;
    border-radius:21px;
    height:100%;
    background:#0d2736;
  }
  .phone-screen>img {
    height:100%;
    width:100%;
    object-fit:cover;
    object-position:30%;
  }
  .phone-screen::after {
    content:'';
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    pointer-events:none;
    background:linear-gradient(#0006,transparent 22%,transparent 55%,#000a);
  }
  .phone-island {
    width:44px;
    height:13px;
    background:#101219;
    position:absolute;
    top:5px;
    left:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    border-radius:10px;
    z-index:4;
  }
  .phone-topline {
    position:absolute;
    top:28px;
    left:12px;
    right:12px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    color:white;
    font-size:7px;
    letter-spacing:1px;
    z-index:3;
  }
  .phone-topline svg {
    width:15px;
    height:15px;
  }
  .focus-bracket {
    width:48px;
    height:48px;
    position:absolute;
    top:36%;
    left:34%;
    border:1px solid #ffffff90;
    border-radius:6px;
  }
  .phone-bottom {
    position:absolute;
    z-index:3;
    bottom:16px;
    left:0;
    right:0;
    text-align:center;
    color:white;
    font-size:6px;
  }
  .phone-bottom>span {
    margin:0 9px;
    color:#fff9;
  }
  .phone-bottom .selected {
    color:var(--accent);
  }
  .shutter {
    width:39px;
    height:39px;
    margin:13px auto 0;
    border:2px solid #fff;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:#fff;
    background-clip:content-box;
    padding:3px;
  }
  .phone-sidekey {
    position:absolute;
    right:-4px;
    top:71px;
    width:2px;
    height:42px;
    background:#6c7181;
  }
  .link-badge {
    position:absolute;
    right:29px;
    top:418px;
    border:1px solid #c7cad5;
    background:#fffffff0;
    box-shadow:0 8px 25px #2328380c;
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    border-radius:50px;
    font-size:10px;
    padding:13px 18px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    transform:rotate(-3deg);
    z-index:5;
  }
  .stage-orbit {
    position:absolute;
    width:1060px;
    height:300px;
    left:50%;
    top:215px;
    border:1px solid #d0d4e1;
    border-radius:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(-10deg);
    z-index:0;
  }
  .orbit-two {
    width:1310px;
    height:380px;
    top:185px;
    border-color:#dcdfe8;
  }
  .stage-floor {
    width:900px;
    height:340px;
    border-radius:50%;
    position:absolute;
    left:50%;
    top:190px;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    background:radial-gradient(ellipse,#c5cce3aa,transparent 68%);
    filter:blur(25px);
    z-index:0;
  }
  .stage-coordinate {
    position:absolute;
    top:220px;
    font:9px monospace;
    letter-spacing:1px;
    color:#7e828e;
    z-index:2;
  }
  .coordinate-left {
    left:5%;
  }
  .coordinate-right {
    right:5%;
  }
  .hero-footnote {
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    margin:0 48px;
    padding:21px 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:9px;
    letter-spacing:1.1px;
    color:#72757d;
  }
  .hero-footnote>span:nth-child(2) {
    letter-spacing:0;
    font-size:10px;
  }
  .hero-footnote a {
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:14px;
  }
  .intro {
    padding-top:130px;
    padding-bottom:140px;
  }
  .intro>.eyebrow {
    margin-bottom:40px;
  }
  .intro-columns {
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;
    gap:80px;
  }
  .intro h2 {
    font-size:clamp(40px,4.8vw,70px);
  }
  .intro-aside {
    max-width:300px;
    padding-top:8px;
    margin-left:auto;
  }
  .intro-aside>p:first-of-type {
    font-size:22px;
    line-height:1.3;
    letter-spacing:-.7px;
    margin:24px 0 20px;
  }
  .intro-aside .body-copy {
    font-size:14px;
  }
  .mini-aperture {
    display:block;
    width:43px;
    height:43px;
    border:1px solid #9297a5;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:repeating-conic-gradient(from 0deg,#adb3c4 0deg 1deg,transparent 1deg 60deg);
    position:relative;
  }
  .mini-aperture::after {
    content:'';
    position:absolute;
    inset:12px;
    border:1px solid #5a6176;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--paper);
  }
  .cinema {
    background:#091a22;
    height:175vh;
    min-height:900px;
    position:relative;
    color:#fff;
    --cinema-progress:0;
  }
  .cinema-sticky {
    height:100vh;
    min-height:620px;
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .cinema-image {
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    clip-path:inset(calc(8% * (1 - var(--cinema-progress))) calc(7% * (1 - var(--cinema-progress))) round calc(20px * (1 - var(--cinema-progress))));
    transform:scale(calc(1 + var(--cinema-progress)*.07));
    will-change:clip-path,transform;
  }
  .cinema-image>img {
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    object-fit:cover;
    object-position:center;
  }
  .cinema-shade {
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,#070d1f80,#070d1f10 80%),linear-gradient(0deg,#02081caa,transparent 40%);
  }
  .cinema-content {
    position:absolute;
    top:26%;
    left:13%;
    transform:translateY(calc(var(--cinema-progress)*-25px));
  }
  .cinema-content .eyebrow {
    font-size:9px;
    margin-bottom:28px;
    color:#c5cce1;
  }
  .cinema-content h2 {
    font-size:clamp(62px,8.4vw,128px);
    line-height:.98;
    text-shadow:0 3px 30px #0b2c4133;
  }
  .cinema-content h2 .serif {
    display:inline-block;
  }
  .cinema-content>p:last-child {
    font-size:15px;
    line-height:1.6;
    margin-top:30px;
    color:#d3d8e6;
  }
  .cinema-reticle {
    position:absolute;
    inset:16% 10%;
    pointer-events:none;
    opacity:calc(.6 - var(--cinema-progress)*.35);
  }
  .cinema-reticle span {
    position:absolute;
    width:28px;
    height:28px;
    border:1px solid white;
  }
  .cinema-reticle span:nth-child(1) {
    left:0;
    top:0;
    border-right:0;
    border-bottom:0;
  }
  .cinema-reticle span:nth-child(2) {
    right:0;
    top:0;
    border-left:0;
    border-bottom:0;
  }
  .cinema-reticle span:nth-child(3) {
    left:0;
    bottom:0;
    border-top:0;
    border-right:0;
  }
  .cinema-reticle span:nth-child(4) {
    right:0;
    bottom:0;
    border-top:0;
    border-left:0;
  }
  .cinema-bottom {
    position:absolute;
    left:10%;
    right:10%;
    bottom:9%;
    font:9px monospace;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:20px;
    color:#c0c6d7;
  }
  .cinema-note {
    font:10px Arial,sans-serif;
    letter-spacing:0;
  }
  .cinema-progress {
    width:130px;
    height:2px;
    background:#ffffff30;
  }
  .cinema-progress i {
    display:block;
    width:calc(8% + var(--cinema-progress)*92%);
    height:100%;
    background:var(--accent);
  }
  .perspective {
    padding-top:140px;
    padding-bottom:115px;
  }
  .section-heading {
    display:flex;
    align-items:flex-end;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:40px;
    margin-bottom:55px;
  }
  .section-heading .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom:29px;
  }
  .section-heading>.body-copy {
    font-size:14px;
    padding-bottom:5px;
  }
  .frame-demo {
    border:1px solid #d1d3db;
    background:#e4e6ec;
    border-radius:18px;
    overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 20px 50px #2a2f3d08;
  }
  .demo-toolbar {
    height:56px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    padding:0 23px;
    border-bottom:1px solid #d2d5dd;
  }
  .demo-brand {
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    font-size:9px;
    letter-spacing:1.4px;
  }
  .demo-tools {
    display:flex;
    gap:7px;
  }
  .icon-button {
    background:transparent;
    border:1px solid transparent;
    display:grid;
    place-items:center;
    width:32px;
    height:32px;
    border-radius:7px;
  }
  .icon-button svg {
    width:16px;
    height:16px;
  }
  .icon-button:hover,.icon-button[aria-pressed=true] {
    background:#cfd3df;
    border-color:#babfcd;
  }
  .demo-image-shell {
    height:460px;
    display:grid;
    place-items:center;
    position:relative;
    background:#131829;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .demo-image-shell::before {
    content:'';
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 100%,#48537644,transparent 70%);
  }
  .demo-crop {
    height:100%;
    width:100%;
    position:relative;
    transition:width .8s var(--ease);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .demo-crop[data-format=portrait] {
    width:30%;
  }
  .demo-crop[data-format=square] {
    width:460px;
  }
  .demo-crop>img {
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    object-fit:cover;
    object-position:35% 48%;
    transition:transform 1.2s var(--ease);
  }
  .demo-crop[data-format=portrait]>img {
    transform:scale(1.05);
  }
  .demo-coordinate {
    position:absolute;
    bottom:23px;
    left:0;
    width:100%;
    text-align:center;
    font-size:8px;
    letter-spacing:2.5px;
    color:#fff;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .composition-grid {
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    opacity:0;
    transition:opacity .3s;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent calc(33.333% - .5px),#fff6 33.333%,transparent calc(33.333% + .5px),transparent calc(66.666% - .5px),#fff6 66.666%,transparent calc(66.666% + .5px)),linear-gradient(transparent calc(33.333% - .5px),#fff6 33.333%,transparent calc(33.333% + .5px),transparent calc(66.666% - .5px),#fff6 66.666%,transparent calc(66.666% + .5px));
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .show-grid .composition-grid {
    opacity:1;
  }
  .demo-footer {
    padding:18px 23px;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    gap:20px;
  }
  .demo-footer p {
    font-size:12px;
  }
  .demo-footer p span {
    color:#6c707d;
  }
  .format-selector {
    display:flex;
    padding:4px;
    background:#d5d8e2;
    border-radius:50px;
    gap:3px;
  }
  .format-selector button {
    border:0;
    background:transparent;
    font-size:10px;
    border-radius:30px;
    padding:10px 15px;
    transition:background .25s;
  }
  .format-selector button[aria-pressed=true] {
    background:#fff;
    box-shadow:0 1px 6px #2b2e3810;
  }
  .illustration-note {
    font-size:10px;
    color:#6e7280;
    text-align:center;
    line-height:1.5;
    margin-top:17px;
  }
  .benefit-row {
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:46px;
    margin-top:70px;
  }
  .benefit-row article {
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top:20px;
  }
  .benefit-number {
    font:10px monospace;
    color:#787d8b;
  }
  .benefit-row h3 {
    font-size:21px;
    margin:26px 0 15px;
  }
  .benefit-row p {
    font-size:13px;
    color:#6b6f7a;
    line-height:1.7;
    max-width:250px;
  }
  .connection {
    background:#dfe2ed;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .connection-inner {
    min-height:630px;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;
    align-items:center;
    gap:45px;
  }
  .connection-copy {
    padding:75px 0;
  }
  .connection-copy .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom:29px;
  }
  .connection h2 {
    font-size:clamp(42px,4.8vw,68px);
  }
  .connection .body-copy {
    font-size:15px;
    margin:27px 0;
  }
  .connection-art {
    height:470px;
    position:relative;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    isolation:isolate;
  }
  .signal-ring {
    position:absolute;
    left:50%;
    top:50%;
    width:340px;
    height:340px;
    border:1px solid #a7b0c9;
    border-radius:50%;
    transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
    z-index:-1;
  }
  .ring-b {
    width:440px;
    height:440px;
    border-color:#b8bfd3;
  }
  .ring-c {
    width:550px;
    height:550px;
    border-color:#c9cedd;
  }
  .connection-line {
    position:absolute;
    left:0;
    right:0;
    top:50%;
    height:1px;
    background:#7a86a9;
    z-index:-1;
  }
  .connection-line::after {
    content:'';
    position:absolute;
    top:-2px;
    width:38px;
    height:5px;
    border-radius:20px;
    background:#48547a;
    box-shadow:0 0 14px #819ae7;
    animation:signal 5s linear infinite;
  }
  .endpoint {
    width:86px;
    height:108px;
    background:#f1f3f9;
    border:1px solid #b0b7cb;
    border-radius:16px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:16px;
    flex-direction:column;
    box-shadow:0 12px 30px #303b5d10;
  }
  .endpoint svg {
    width:26px;
    height:26px;
    stroke-width:1;
  }
  .endpoint span {
    font-size:7px;
    letter-spacing:1px;
  }
  .endpoint-phone {
    transform:rotate(-8deg);
  }
  .endpoint-pc {
    width:105px;
    height:85px;
    transform:rotate(8deg);
  }
  .connection-core {
    width:90px;
    height:90px;
    background:#1d202a;
    color:var(--accent);
    border-radius:26px;
    display:grid;
    place-items:center;
    box-shadow:0 15px 30px #232e5026,0 0 0 11px #d0d5e4;
  }
  .connection-core svg {
    width:43px;
    height:43px;
    stroke-width:1.1;
  }
  .connection-label {
    position:absolute;
    bottom:35px;
    left:0;
    right:0;
    text-align:center;
    font:8px monospace;
    letter-spacing:1.6px;
    color:#525a73;
  }
  .setup {
    padding-top:125px;
    padding-bottom:115px;
  }
  .setup-steps {
    list-style:none;
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .setup-steps li {
    padding:24px 36px 30px 0;
    position:relative;
  }
  .setup-steps li+li {
    border-left:1px solid var(--line);
    padding-left:36px;
  }
  .step-index {
    font:10px monospace;
    color:#6f7482;
  }
  .step-icon {
    height:95px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    margin-top:12px;
  }
  .step-icon svg {
    width:44px;
    height:44px;
    stroke-width:1;
  }
  .setup-steps h3 {
    font-size:25px;
    margin:15px 0;
  }
  .setup-steps p {
    font-size:13px;
    line-height:1.75;
    color:#6a6e78;
    max-width:270px;
  }
  .connect-icon {
    gap:7px;
  }
  .connect-icon i {
    width:8px;
    height:8px;
    border:1px solid #666d83;
    border-radius:50%;
  }
  .connect-icon i:nth-child(2) {
    width:14px;
    height:14px;
    background:#bfc5d6;
  }
  .setup-note {
    font-size:11px;
    line-height:1.6;
    color:#6a6e78;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top:22px;
  }
  .download {
    background:var(--dark);
    color:var(--paper);
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .download-inner {
    position:relative;
    padding-top:100px;
    padding-bottom:54px;
    z-index:2;
  }
  .download-glow {
    position:absolute;
    left:50%;
    top:-250px;
    width:1100px;
    height:780px;
    border-radius:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    background:radial-gradient(ellipse,#263f8c30,transparent 62%);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .download .eyebrow {
    color:#acb2c4;
    justify-content:center;
    margin-bottom:28px;
    font-size:9px;
  }
  .download .status-dot {
    background:var(--accent);
  }
  .download :is(h1,h2) {
    text-align:center;
    font-size:clamp(65px,7.5vw,110px);
  }
  .download :is(h1,h2) .serif {
    color:var(--accent);
  }
  .download-description {
    margin-top:25px;
    color:#9397a4;
    font-size:14px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .download-cards {
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:20px;
    max-width:790px;
    margin:55px auto 0;
  }
  .download-card {
    border:1px solid #323643;
    border-radius:17px;
    padding:35px;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1f243345,#191b2333);
    position:relative;
  }
  .platform-icon {
    width:27px;
    height:27px;
    color:#c9d0e6;
    margin-bottom:33px;
    stroke-width:1.1;
  }
  .platform-label {
    display:block;
    font-size:8px;
    letter-spacing:1.6px;
    color:#969eb5;
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .download-card h3 {
    font-size:32px;
  }
  .download-card p {
    font-size:12px;
    color:#9b9fad;
    margin:14px 0 28px;
  }
  .download-card .button {
    width:100%;
    justify-content:space-between;
    padding:17px 19px;
  }
  .download-meta {
    font-size:9px;
    display:block;
    text-align:center;
    margin-top:15px;
    color:#949aae;
  }
  .release-row {
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:25px;
    align-items:center;
    max-width:790px;
    margin:25px auto 0;
    font-size:10px;
    color:#979db0;
    line-height:1.7;
  }
  .release-row .text-link {
    font-size:10px;
    white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .site-footer {
    background:#111217;
    color:#f0f1f5;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr auto;
    align-items:center;
    gap:36px;
    border-top:1px solid #282c38;
    padding:36px 48px 28px;
  }
  .site-footer .brand {
    font-size:17px;
  }
  .site-footer .brand-mark {
    background:var(--accent);
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .site-footer>p {
    color:#9499a8;
    font-size:11px;
  }
  .site-footer>.text-link {
    font-size:11px;
  }
  .copyright {
    grid-column:1/-1;
    color:#767b8b;
    font-size:9px;
    margin-top:3px;
  }
  #scene-dialog {
    background:#101a1f;
    color:white;
    border:1px solid #4d5261;
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:12px;
    max-width:min(1100px,94vw);
    max-height:94vh;
    box-shadow:0 20px 100px #0006;
  }
  #scene-dialog::backdrop {
    background:#050813df;
    backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
  }
  #scene-dialog>img {
    max-height:75vh;
    width:100%;
    object-fit:contain;
    border-radius:5px;
  }
  #scene-dialog p {
    font-size:13px;
    padding:19px 9px 8px;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:15px;
  }
  #scene-dialog p span {
    color:#939bb5;
    font-size:11px;
  }
  .dialog-close {
    display:flex;
    gap:15px;
    align-items:center;
    border:0;
    color:white;
    background:transparent;
    padding:8px 7px 16px;
    margin-left:auto;
    font-size:12px;
  }
  .dialog-close span {
    font-size:22px;
  }
}
@layer motion {
  @keyframes signal {
    from {
      left:0;
      opacity:0;
    }
    10% {
      opacity:1;
    }
    90% {
      opacity:1;
    }
    to {
      left:calc(100% - 38px);
      opacity:0;
    }
  }
  @keyframes rise {
    from {
      opacity:0;
      transform:translateY(24px);
    }
    to {
      opacity:1;
      transform:translateY(0);
    }
  }
  .hero-copy .eyebrow {
    animation:rise .8s var(--ease) both;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    animation:rise 1s .1s var(--ease) both;
  }
  .hero-description,.hero-actions {
    animation:rise 1s .25s var(--ease) both;
  }
  .reveal-ready .reveal {
    opacity:0;
    transform:translateY(28px);
    transition:opacity .9s var(--ease),transform .9s var(--ease);
  }
  .reveal-ready .reveal.is-visible {
    opacity:1;
    transform:none;
  }
  .benefit-row .reveal:nth-child(2),.setup-steps .reveal:nth-child(2) {
    transition-delay:.09s;
  }
  .benefit-row .reveal:nth-child(3),.setup-steps .reveal:nth-child(3) {
    transition-delay:.18s;
  }
  .motion-paused *,.motion-paused *::before,.motion-paused *::after {
    animation:none!important;
    transition:none!important;
  }
  .motion-paused {
    scroll-behavior:auto;
  }
  .motion-paused .reveal {
    opacity:1;
    transform:none;
  }
  .motion-paused .cinema-image {
    clip-path:none;
    transform:none;
  }
  .motion-paused .cinema-content {
    transform:none;
  }
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) {
    html {
      scroll-behavior:auto;
    }
    *,*::before,*::after {
      animation:none!important;
      transition:none!important;
    }
    .reveal-ready .reveal {
      opacity:1;
      transform:none;
    }
    .cinema-image {
      clip-path:none;
      transform:none;
    }
    .cinema-content {
      transform:none;
    }
    .cinema {
      height:auto;
      min-height:0;
    }
    .cinema-sticky {
      position:relative;
      height:800px;
    }
  }
}
@layer responsive {
  @media(min-width:1600px) {
    .hero-copy {
      padding-top:86px;
    }
    .device-stage {
      margin-top:25px;
      height:670px;
    }
    .device-rig {
      transform:translateX(-50%) scale(1.12);
      transform-origin:center top;
      top:65px;
    }
  }
  @media(max-width:1100px) {
    .site-header {
      padding:0 30px;
    }
    .section-shell {
      width:calc(100% - 72px);
    }
    .device-rig {
      transform:translateX(-50%) scale(.83);
      transform-origin:center top;
      top:60px;
    }
    .device-stage {
      height:520px;
    }
    .stage-coordinate {
      display:none;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size:clamp(62px,8vw,94px);
    }
    .intro-columns {
      gap:40px;
    }
    .cinema-content {
      left:10%;
    }
    .connection-inner {
      gap:45px;
    }
    .connection-art {
      transform:scale(.85);
      transform-origin:center;
    }
    .connection-copy h2 {
      font-size:48px;
    }
    .demo-image-shell {
      height:390px;
    }
    .demo-crop[data-format=square] {
      width:390px;
    }
    .desktop-nav {
      gap:19px;
    }
    .site-footer {
      padding-inline:36px;
    }
    .hero-footnote {
      margin-inline:36px;
    }
  }
  @media(max-width:760px) {
    :root {
      --header-height:64px;
    }
    .site-header {
      height:64px;
      padding:0 22px;
    }
    .brand {
      font-size:16px;
    }
    .brand-mark {
      width:25px;
      height:25px;
      border-radius:8px;
    }
    .brand-mark svg {
      width:17px;
      height:17px;
    }
    .desktop-nav {
      display:none;
    }
    .nav-actions {
      gap:10px;
    }
    .button-small {
      font-size:10px;
      padding:10px 13px;
      gap:12px;
    }
    .motion-toggle {
      width:26px;
      height:26px;
    }
    .menu-toggle {
      display:block;
    }
    .section-shell {
      width:calc(100% - 44px);
    }
    .hero-copy {
      padding:54px 18px 0;
    }
    .hero .eyebrow {
      font-size:8px;
      letter-spacing:.12em;
      margin-bottom:22px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size:clamp(45px,8.8vw,67px);
      letter-spacing:-.06em;
    }
    .hero-description {
      font-size:13px;
      margin-top:23px;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      gap:18px;
      margin-top:25px;
    }
    .hero-actions>.button {
      font-size:11px;
      padding:14px 18px;
      gap:16px;
    }
    .hero-actions .text-link {
      font-size:10px;
      gap:8px;
    }
    .device-stage {
      height:390px;
      margin-top:10px;
    }
    .device-rig {
      transform:translateX(-50%) scale(.6);
      top:40px;
    }
    .stage-orbit {
      transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(-10deg) scale(.65);
      top:65px;
    }
    .orbit-two {
      top:18px;
    }
    .stage-floor {
      width:620px;
      top:50px;
    }
    .hero-footnote {
      margin-inline:22px;
      font-size:8px;
      padding:17px 0;
    }
    .hero-footnote>span:nth-child(2) {
      font-size:8px;
    }
    .hero-footnote a span {
      display:none;
    }
    .intro {
      padding-top:77px;
      padding-bottom:80px;
    }
    .intro>.eyebrow {
      margin-bottom:28px;
    }
    .eyebrow {
      font-size:9px;
    }
    .intro-columns {
      grid-template-columns:1fr;
      gap:30px;
    }
    .intro h2 {
      font-size:clamp(40px,7.6vw,58px);
    }
    .intro-aside {
      margin-left:0;
      max-width:100%;
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:45px 1fr;
      gap:17px 23px;
    }
    .intro-aside>p:first-of-type {
      font-size:19px;
      margin:0;
    }
    .intro-aside .body-copy {
      grid-column:2;
      font-size:14px;
      max-width:370px;
    }
    .mini-aperture {
      width:36px;
      height:36px;
      margin-top:5px;
    }
    .mini-aperture::after {
      inset:10px;
    }
    .cinema {
      height:130vh;
      min-height:780px;
    }
    .cinema-sticky {
      height:85vh;
      min-height:580px;
    }
    .cinema-image {
      clip-path:none;
    }
    .cinema-image>img {
      object-position:37% center;
    }
    .cinema-content {
      left:8%;
      top:29%;
    }
    .cinema-content h2 {
      font-size:clamp(56px,10.2vw,80px);
    }
    .cinema-content .eyebrow {
      font-size:8px;
      margin-bottom:25px;
    }
    .cinema-content>p:last-child {
      font-size:13px;
    }
    .cinema-reticle {
      inset:15% 6%;
    }
    .cinema-bottom {
      left:8%;
      right:8%;
      bottom:7%;
      font-size:8px;
    }
    .cinema-note {
      font-size:9px;
      max-width:155px;
      line-height:1.6;
    }
    .cinema-progress {
      width:60px;
    }
    .perspective {
      padding-top:80px;
      padding-bottom:75px;
    }
    .section-heading {
      display:block;
      margin-bottom:32px;
    }
    .section-heading :is(h1,h2) {
      font-size:45px;
    }
    .section-heading .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom:24px;
    }
    .section-heading>.body-copy {
      font-size:13px;
      margin-top:25px;
    }
    .demo-toolbar {
      height:48px;
      padding-inline:14px;
    }
    .demo-brand {
      font-size:7px;
      letter-spacing:1px;
    }
    .demo-image-shell {
      height:310px;
    }
    .demo-crop[data-format=portrait] {
      width:52%;
    }
    .demo-crop[data-format=square] {
      width:310px;
    }
    .demo-footer {
      padding:15px;
      flex-direction:column;
      gap:13px;
    }
    .demo-footer p {
      font-size:11px;
    }
    .format-selector {
      width:100%;
      justify-content:center;
    }
    .format-selector button {
      flex:1;
      font-size:10px;
    }
    .illustration-note {
      font-size:9px;
      margin-top:12px;
      padding:0 10px;
    }
    .benefit-row {
      grid-template-columns:1fr;
      gap:24px;
      margin-top:43px;
    }
    .benefit-row article {
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:25px 1fr;
      gap:9px 15px;
      padding-top:22px;
    }
    .benefit-number {
      padding-top:4px;
    }
    .benefit-row h3 {
      font-size:20px;
      margin:0;
    }
    .benefit-row p {
      grid-column:2;
      max-width:100%;
      font-size:13px;
    }
    .connection-inner {
      display:flex;
      flex-direction:column;
      align-items:stretch;
      gap:0;
    }
    .connection-copy {
      padding:70px 0 0;
    }
    .connection-copy h2 {
      font-size:46px;
    }
    .connection-copy .body-copy {
      font-size:14px;
      margin:22px 0;
    }
    .connection-art {
      height:390px;
      transform:scale(.85);
      width:min(450px,100%);
      margin:auto;
    }
    .signal-ring {
      width:280px;
      height:280px;
    }
    .ring-b {
      width:380px;
      height:380px;
    }
    .ring-c {
      width:480px;
      height:480px;
    }
    .connection-label {
      bottom:14px;
    }
    .setup {
      padding-top:75px;
      padding-bottom:70px;
    }
    .setup-steps {
      grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }
    .setup-steps li,.setup-steps li+li {
      padding:27px 0 27px 65px;
      border-left:0;
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .step-index {
      position:absolute;
      left:0;
      top:33px;
    }
    .step-icon {
      position:absolute;
      left:0;
      top:59px;
      margin:0;
      height:40px;
    }
    .step-icon svg {
      width:29px;
      height:29px;
    }
    .setup-steps h3 {
      font-size:24px;
      margin:0 0 12px;
    }
    .setup-steps p {
      max-width:100%;
      font-size:13px;
    }
    .connect-icon {
      gap:4px;
    }
    .connect-icon i {
      width:5px;
      height:5px;
    }
    .connect-icon i:nth-child(2) {
      width:9px;
      height:9px;
    }
    .setup-note {
      border:0;
      font-size:10px;
    }
    .download-inner {
      padding-top:72px;
      padding-bottom:35px;
    }
    .download :is(h1,h2) {
      font-size:65px;
    }
    .download .eyebrow {
      font-size:8px;
      letter-spacing:.09em;
    }
    .download-description {
      font-size:13px;
      margin-top:20px;
    }
    .download-cards {
      gap:13px;
      margin-top:35px;
    }
    .download-card {
      padding:22px 17px;
      border-radius:13px;
    }
    .platform-icon {
      width:23px;
      height:23px;
      margin-bottom:23px;
    }
    .platform-label {
      font-size:6px;
      letter-spacing:1.2px;
    }
    .download-card h3 {
      font-size:25px;
    }
    .download-card p {
      font-size:11px;
      line-height:1.5;
      min-height:33px;
      margin:10px 0 20px;
    }
    .download-card .button {
      font-size:10px;
      padding:13px 12px;
      gap:6px;
    }
    .download-card .button svg {
      width:14px;
      height:14px;
    }
    .download-meta {
      font-size:8px;
      line-height:1.5;
    }
    .release-row {
      align-items:flex-start;
      font-size:9px;
      gap:18px;
    }
    .release-row .text-link {
      font-size:9px;
      gap:6px;
    }
    .site-footer {
      padding:30px 22px 24px;
      grid-template-columns:1fr auto;
      gap:22px;
    }
    .site-footer>p {
      grid-column:1;
      grid-row:2;
      font-size:10px;
    }
    .site-footer>.text-link {
      grid-column:2;
      grid-row:1;
    }
    .copyright {
      font-size:8px;
    }
    .site-footer .brand {
      font-size:16px;
    }
  }
  @media(max-width:480px) {
    .device-stage {
      height:295px;
      margin-top:15px;
    }
    .device-rig {
      transform:translateX(-50%) scale(.445);
      top:24px;
    }
    .stage-orbit {
      transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(-10deg) scale(.48);
      top:3px;
    }
    .orbit-two {
      top:-43px;
    }
    .stage-floor {
      top:0;
      width:440px;
      height:220px;
    }
    .nav-actions {
      gap:7px;
    }
    .nav-actions>.button {
      gap:8px;
    }
    .nav-actions>.button svg {
      display:none;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      gap:15px;
    }
    .hero-actions .text-link {
      font-size:9px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size:clamp(42px,9.1vw,47px);
    }
    .hero-footnote>span:nth-child(2) {
      font-size:7px;
    }
    .download-card h3 {
      font-size:23px;
    }
    .download-card .button {
      font-size:9px;
      padding-inline:10px;
    }
    .download-card .button svg {
      width:12px;
      height:12px;
    }
    .download-meta {
      font-size:7px;
    }
    .download :is(h1,h2) {
      font-size:59px;
    }
    .connection-copy h2 {
      font-size:42px;
    }
    .section-heading :is(h1,h2) {
      font-size:42px;
    }
    .demo-image-shell {
      height:265px;
    }
    .demo-crop[data-format=square] {
      width:265px;
    }
    .hero-copy {
      padding-top:46px;
    }
    .cinema-content h2 {
      font-size:56px;
    }
  }
  @media(max-width:350px) {
    .site-header {
      padding-inline:16px;
    }
    .motion-toggle {
      display:none;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size:39px;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      gap:10px;
    }
    .hero-actions>.button {
      padding:13px 14px;
      font-size:10px;
    }
    .download-cards {
      grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }
    .download-card p {
      min-height:0;
    }
    .download-card .button {
      font-size:12px;
    }
    .download-meta {
      font-size:9px;
    }
  }
}

/* Revision 2: Samsung hardware, real use cases and modular product stories. */
@layer base {
  [hidden] { display:none !important; }
  figure { margin:0; }
}
@layer components {
  .galaxy-stage { height:auto; aspect-ratio:1.95; max-width:1140px; margin:35px auto 0; overflow:hidden; border-radius:22px; background:#ebf1fc; }
  .galaxy-hero-frame { width:100%; height:100%; transform:translateY(calc(var(--hero-progress)*-12px)); }
  .galaxy-hero-frame img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:50% 52%; }
  .galaxy-model { position:absolute; bottom:24px; padding:11px 15px; border:1px solid #ffffff70; border-radius:8px; background:#f7f9ffdf; color:#1c2c50; font-size:11px; backdrop-filter:blur(12px); }
  .galaxy-model span { display:block; font-size:7px; letter-spacing:1.4px; margin-top:5px; color:#647492; }
  .model-phone { left:25px; } .model-book { right:25px; }
  .hero-footnote { margin-top:25px; }
  .use-cases { padding-block:105px; }
  .use-case-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:24px; }
  .use-card { border-radius:18px; overflow:hidden; background:white; border:1px solid #dce2ee; }
  .use-image { position:relative; aspect-ratio:1.5; overflow:hidden; }
  .use-image img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; transition:transform 1s var(--ease); }
  .use-card:hover .use-image img { transform:scale(1.035); }
  .image-chip { position:absolute; bottom:20px; left:22px; padding:9px 12px; border-radius:30px; color:#fff; background:#16223dd9; font-size:8px; letter-spacing:1.3px; }
  .use-card-copy { padding:32px; }
  .use-card h3 { font-size:37px; line-height:1.07; margin:17px 0 22px; letter-spacing:-1.6px; }
  .use-card p:not(.eyebrow) { font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; color:#65718a; margin-bottom:23px; }
  .use-card strong { font-weight:500; color:inherit; }
  .use-dark { background:#15182a; border-color:#2c344e; color:#f5f7ff; }
  .use-dark p:not(.eyebrow) { color:#a8b2cf; }
  .use-dark .eyebrow { color:#b8b5ff; }
  .use-case-strip { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:24px; padding:32px 0; margin-top:28px; border-block:1px solid #dce2ee; }
  .strip-symbol { font-size:38px; color:#416de2; }
  .use-case-strip h3 { font-size:25px; margin-bottom:10px; }
  .use-case-strip p { font-size:13px; line-height:1.7; color:#68758d; max-width:680px; }
  .use-tag { margin-left:auto; font-size:8px; letter-spacing:1.2px; white-space:nowrap; }
  .app-showcase { background:#0e1220; color:#f5f7ff; padding-block:110px; overflow:hidden; }
  .app-showcase .body-copy { color:#a8b5d0; }
  .app-gallery { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 195px; gap:30px; align-items:center; }
  .app-desktop { min-width:0; background:#0d1014; border:1px solid #526079; border-radius:9px; box-shadow:0 25px 70px #0005; position:relative; }
  .app-window-chrome { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:12px 16px; background:#252c3a; color:#b8c5dc; font-size:10px; border-radius:9px 9px 0 0; }
  .app-desktop img { width:100%; height:auto; }
  .app-gallery figcaption { padding:14px 8px; font-size:8px; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-align:center; color:#a8b5d0; }
  .app-mobile { padding:12px 4px 4px; background:linear-gradient(120deg,#9ca6b7,#303947); border-radius:9px; position:relative; box-shadow:0 20px 45px #0005; }
  .app-mobile img { border-radius:3px; width:100%; height:auto; }
  .app-mobile figcaption { background:#101624; }
  .app-punch-hole { position:absolute; left:calc(50% - 3px); top:4px; width:6px; height:6px; background:#111; border-radius:50%; }
  .app-source-note { font-size:10px; line-height:1.7; text-align:center; color:#99a8c3; margin:25px auto 0; max-width:730px; }
  .app-feature-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:35px; margin-top:60px; }
  .app-feature-grid article { border-top:1px solid #34405a; padding-top:21px; }
  .app-feature-grid article>span { font:10px monospace; color:#88a8ff; }
  .app-feature-grid h3 { font-size:24px; margin:21px 0 16px; }
  .app-feature-grid p { font-size:13px; line-height:1.7; color:#a6b2ca; }
  .lens-section,.comparison-section { padding-block:100px 20px; }
  .lens-showcase { border-radius:19px; overflow:hidden; background:#101827; border:1px solid #3a4965; }
  .lens-view { aspect-ratio:2.05; position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
  .lens-view>img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:35% 45%; transform:scale(1.35); transition:transform 1s var(--ease); }
  .lens-view-label { position:absolute; bottom:25px; left:28px; color:white; font:9px monospace; letter-spacing:1px; }
  .lens-focus { position:absolute; top:calc(50% - 30px); left:calc(50% - 30px); width:60px; height:60px; border:1px solid #fffb; border-radius:8px; }
  .lens-console { display:flex; gap:45px; align-items:center; padding:30px 40px; color:#e8efff; min-height:215px; }
  .s24-back { width:100px; height:180px; border-radius:6px; border:2px solid #969cab; background:linear-gradient(120deg,#a4a9b3,#747b88 80%); position:relative; flex:none; transform:rotate(-7deg); }
  .lens-ring { position:absolute; left:11px; width:23px; height:23px; border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(circle,#294379 0 11%,#0a1020 16% 40%,#4e5e73 43% 52%,#11151d 58% 75%,#a8b0bd 80%); box-shadow:1px 1px 3px #101523; }
  .lens-ring-one { top:13px; } .lens-ring-two { top:45px; } .lens-ring-three { top:77px; } .lens-ring-four { top:48px; left:43px; width:17px; height:17px; }
  .lens-ring.selected { outline:2px solid #97b6ff; outline-offset:4px; box-shadow:0 0 18px #5282ffc0; }
  .lens-flash { position:absolute; top:22px; left:48px; width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background:#ebe5d8; }
  .back-wordmark { position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:14px; font-size:9px; letter-spacing:1px; color:#525966; }
  .lens-selector { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:9px; margin-block:17px; }
  .lens-selector button { border:1px solid #586583; color:#b6c4df; background:transparent; border-radius:30px; padding:12px 20px; font-size:12px; }
  .lens-selector button[aria-pressed=true] { background:#acc4ff; color:#15223f; border-color:#acc4ff; }
  .lens-controls>p:last-child { color:#a6b8d9; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; }
  .comparison { position:relative; aspect-ratio:1.8; overflow:hidden; border-radius:18px; isolation:isolate; background:#192338; }
  .comparison>img,.compare-soft,.compare-soft>img { position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; }
  .compare-soft { clip-path:inset(0 calc(100% - var(--split)) 0 0); }
  .compare-soft>img { filter:blur(2.2px) saturate(.68) contrast(.88); }
  .compare-labels { position:absolute; inset:20px 22px auto; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:25px; color:white; pointer-events:none; }
  .compare-labels>span { font:9px monospace; letter-spacing:.8px; padding:10px 13px; background:#0b1733b8; border-radius:5px; }
  .compare-labels small { display:block; font:10px Arial; letter-spacing:0; margin-top:5px; color:#c7d3e8; }
  .comparison-handle { position:absolute; top:0; bottom:0; width:2px; left:var(--split); background:white; pointer-events:none; }
  .comparison-handle i { position:absolute; top:50%; left:50%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%); width:47px; height:47px; border-radius:50%; display:grid; place-items:center; background:white; color:#254480; font-size:24px; font-style:normal; box-shadow:0 3px 15px #0004; }
  #comparison-range { position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; margin:0; appearance:none; background:transparent; cursor:ew-resize; opacity:0; touch-action:pan-y; }
  .comparison:focus-within { outline:3px solid #3866da; outline-offset:5px; }
  #comparison-range::-webkit-slider-thumb { appearance:none; width:40px; height:100%; background:transparent; }
  #comparison-range::-moz-range-thumb { width:40px; height:100%; background:transparent; border:0; }
  .comparison-disclaimer { position:absolute; bottom:18px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); padding:8px 12px; background:#0a153bcc; color:#fff; border-radius:4px; font:8px monospace; white-space:nowrap; pointer-events:none; }
  .demo-crop[data-format=flipped]>img { transform:rotate(180deg); }
  .connectivity-section { padding-block:100px; background:#eaf0ff; }
  .connection-tabs { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-bottom:32px; }
  .connection-tabs button { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; border:1px solid #c5d0e7; background:#f9fbff; border-radius:11px; padding:16px 18px; font-size:12px; }
  .connection-tabs svg { width:18px; height:18px; }
  .connection-tabs small { font-size:7px; letter-spacing:.5px; background:#e6e2ff; padding:4px 6px; border-radius:4px; }
  .connection-tabs button[aria-selected=true] { background:#1c3675; color:white; border-color:#1c3675; }
  .connection-tabs button[aria-selected=true] small { background:#746aad; }
  .connection-panel { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr; align-items:center; gap:35px; min-height:430px; }
  .feature-status { display:inline-flex; padding:6px 9px; background:#d8e4ff; color:#284e9e; border-radius:5px; font-size:8px; letter-spacing:.8px; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:20px; }
  .feature-status.planned { background:#e6e0ff; color:#5a3b9e; }
  .connection-story .eyebrow { font-size:8px; margin-bottom:18px; }
  .connection-story h3 { font-size:40px; line-height:1.07; letter-spacing:-1.5px; margin-bottom:22px; }
  .connection-story>p:not(.eyebrow) { font-size:14px; line-height:1.7; color:#536383; }
  .connection-steps { margin:23px 0; padding-left:19px; font-size:12px; line-height:2.2; color:#344c78; }
  .connection-story .connection-note,.connection-note { font-size:10px!important; color:#66789a!important; line-height:1.7; }
  .transport-visual { position:relative; width:100%; aspect-ratio:600 / 360; isolation:isolate; }
  .transport-grid { position:absolute; inset:0; border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(ellipse,#bbceff80,transparent 70%); }
  .transport-phone { position:absolute; left:11%; top:23%; width:17%; height:49%; background:#8590a5; border:1px solid #536078; border-radius:5px; padding:4px; z-index:3; }
  .transport-phone-screen { height:100%; overflow:hidden; background:#0d1014; }
  .transport-phone-screen img { width:100%; height:auto; }
  .transport-hole { position:absolute; top:5px; left:calc(50% - 2px); width:4px; height:4px; background:#050914; border-radius:50%; z-index:4; }
  .phone-sleep { display:none; position:absolute; inset:6px; background:#152445; color:#bfd1ff; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:12px; }
  .phone-sleep span { font-size:6px; }
  .transport-laptop { position:absolute; left:48%; top:30%; width:47%; padding:6px 5px 12px; background:#273144; border:1px solid #8591a8; border-radius:6px; z-index:3; }
  .transport-laptop img { width:100%; height:auto; }
  .transport-laptop::after { content:''; position:absolute; height:6px; left:-6%; right:-6%; bottom:-5px; border-radius:1px 1px 50% 50%; background:#8898b4; }
  .transport-bezel { position:absolute; bottom:3px; left:44%; font-size:4px; letter-spacing:1px; color:#aeb9c9; }
  .transport-webcam { position:absolute; top:2px; left:50%; width:2px; height:2px; border-radius:50%; background:#b6c5e8; }
  .transport-label { position:absolute; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); bottom:-29px; color:#475f8c; font-size:8px; white-space:nowrap; }
  .transport-path { position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; fill:none; z-index:2; }
  .wireless-route { stroke:#749cfa; stroke-width:1.5; stroke-dasharray:5 7; animation:wireless-flow 2s linear infinite; }
  .cable-route { stroke:#384e78; stroke-width:5; }
  .cable-pulse { stroke:#99bcff; stroke-width:2; stroke-dasharray:12 300; animation:cable-flow 3s linear infinite; }
  .usb-plug { fill:#9baac5; stroke:#4c6187; }
  .connection-panel:not([data-visual=cable]) .cable-route,.connection-panel:not([data-visual=cable]) .cable-pulse,.connection-panel:not([data-visual=cable]) .usb-plug { display:none; }
  .connection-panel[data-visual=cable] .wireless-route,.connection-panel[data-visual=cable] .wifi-router,.connection-panel[data-visual=cable] .device-wifi { display:none; }
  .device-wifi { position:absolute; top:-34px; left:calc(50% - 12px); color:#396ede; animation:wifi-glow 3s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .device-wifi svg { width:24px; height:24px; }
  .wifi-router { position:absolute; top:0; left:43%; display:flex; align-items:center; flex-direction:column; color:#386ddd; gap:9px; }
  .wifi-router span { font-size:6px; letter-spacing:1px; }
  .transport-caption { position:absolute; bottom:0; left:0; right:0; text-align:center; font:8px monospace; letter-spacing:1px; color:#536e9d; }
  .connection-panel[data-auto-open=true] .phone-sleep { display:flex; animation:auto-open-demo 7s infinite; }
  .connection-panel[data-auto-open=true] .usb-plug { animation:plug-demo 7s infinite; }
  .usb-scroll-story { height:150vh; min-height:900px; background:#0d1428; color:#edf3ff; --usb-progress:0; }
  .usb-sticky { min-height:650px; height:100vh; position:sticky; top:0; display:grid; grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.3fr; align-items:center; gap:15px; }
  .usb-copy h2 { font-size:68px; margin:12px 0 25px; }
  .usb-copy>p { color:#a5b5d8; font-size:14px; line-height:1.8; }
  .usb-copy .connection-note { margin-top:24px; color:#91a7ce!important; max-width:300px; }
  .usb-scroll-visual { min-width:0; }
  .usb-scroll-visual>svg { width:100%; height:auto; stroke:none; }
  .usb-stage-caption { display:block; margin-top:28px; color:#b3caff; font:9px monospace; letter-spacing:1px; }
  .usb-sleep-screen { opacity:calc(1 - var(--usb-progress)); }
  .closing-cta { padding-block:105px; text-align:center; }
  .closing-cta .eyebrow { justify-content:center; margin-bottom:25px; }
  .closing-cta>div { display:flex; gap:27px; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin-top:35px; }
  .github-links { display:flex; gap:24px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .download-details { padding-block:90px; }
  .requirements-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:50px; margin:45px 0; }
  .requirements-grid h3 { font-size:24px; margin-bottom:18px; }
  .requirements-grid p { font-size:14px; line-height:1.8; color:#627391; }
  .download-details .setup-note { margin-top:30px; }
  .guide-details { padding-block:0 90px; }
  .guide-heading { margin-bottom:45px; }
  .guide-heading .eyebrow { margin-bottom:22px; }
  .guide-details article { padding:35px 0; border-top:1px solid #d0d9eb; }
  .guide-details article>span { color:#5f79ac; font:10px monospace; }
  .guide-details h3 { font-size:31px; margin:18px 0; }
  .guide-details li,.guide-details article>p { font-size:15px; line-height:1.9; color:#5c6f90; }
  .guide-details ol { padding-left:20px; }
  .guide-finish { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:25px; margin-top:35px; }
}
@layer motion {
  @keyframes wireless-flow { to { stroke-dashoffset:-24; } }
  @keyframes cable-flow { to { stroke-dashoffset:-312; } }
  @keyframes wifi-glow { 0%,100% { opacity:.4; } 50% { opacity:1; } }
  @keyframes auto-open-demo { 0%,30% { opacity:1; } 45%,95% { opacity:0; } 100% { opacity:1; } }
  @keyframes plug-demo { 0%,10% { transform:translateY(25px); } 30%,95% { transform:translateY(0); } 100% { transform:translateY(25px); } }
  .motion-paused .usb-scroll-story { height:auto; min-height:0; }
  .motion-paused .usb-sticky { position:relative; height:auto; }
  .motion-paused .phone-sleep { display:none!important; }
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .usb-scroll-story { height:auto; min-height:0; } .usb-sticky { position:relative; height:auto; } .phone-sleep { display:none!important; } }
}
@layer responsive {
  @media(max-width:1100px) {
    .galaxy-stage { width:calc(100% - 72px); }
    .app-gallery { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 165px; gap:22px; }
    .connection-panel { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:20px; }
    .usb-copy h2 { font-size:53px; }
  }
  @media(max-width:760px) {
    .galaxy-stage { width:calc(100% - 32px); height:auto; aspect-ratio:1.4; border-radius:12px; margin-top:30px; }
    .galaxy-hero-frame img { object-fit:cover; object-position:45% 50%; }
    .galaxy-model { bottom:12px; padding:8px 10px; font-size:9px; }
    .model-phone { left:12px; } .model-book { right:12px; }
    .galaxy-model span { font-size:6px; }
    .hero-footnote { margin-top:18px; }
    .use-cases,.app-showcase,.connectivity-section { padding-block:70px; }
    .use-case-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:24px; }
    .use-card-copy { padding:26px; }
    .use-card h3 { font-size:34px; }
    .use-case-strip { gap:15px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .use-case-strip>div { flex:1; min-width:220px; }
    .use-tag { margin-left:44px; }
    .app-gallery { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:26px; }
    .app-mobile { width:180px; margin-inline:auto; }
    .app-source-note { font-size:9px; }
    .app-feature-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:26px; margin-top:35px; }
    .app-feature-grid h3 { margin-block:13px; }
    .lens-section,.comparison-section { padding-block:70px 0; }
    .lens-view { aspect-ratio:1.3; }
    .lens-console { padding:24px 18px; gap:23px; align-items:flex-start; }
    .s24-back { width:76px; height:144px; }
    .back-wordmark { font-size:7px; left:9px; }
    .lens-selector { gap:6px; }
    .lens-selector button { font-size:10px; padding:10px 13px; }
    .lens-controls .eyebrow { font-size:7px; }
    .lens-controls>p:last-child { font-size:11px; }
    .lens-view-label { font-size:8px; left:18px; bottom:18px; }
    .comparison { aspect-ratio:1.2; }
    .compare-labels { inset:12px 10px auto; gap:8px; }
    .compare-labels>span { font-size:6px; padding:8px; letter-spacing:0; }
    .compare-labels small { font-size:8px; }
    .comparison-disclaimer { font-size:6px; bottom:12px; }
    .connection-tabs { gap:8px; }
    .connection-tabs button { padding:12px; font-size:10px; }
    .connection-tabs small { font-size:6px; }
    .connection-panel { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:28px; }
    .connection-story h3 { font-size:36px; }
    .transport-visual { max-width:580px; margin-inline:auto; }
    .transport-label { font-size:7px; }
    .usb-scroll-story { height:145vh; min-height:850px; }
    .usb-sticky { grid-template-columns:1fr; align-content:center; height:100svh; min-height:610px; gap:24px; padding-block:40px; }
    .usb-copy h2 { font-size:46px; }
    .usb-copy>p { font-size:12px; }
    .usb-copy .connection-note { max-width:100%; font-size:9px!important; margin-top:15px; }
    .usb-scroll-visual { width:100%; }
    .usb-stage-caption { margin-top:16px; font-size:8px; }
    .closing-cta { padding-block:75px; }
    .closing-cta>div { flex-direction:column; gap:20px; }
    .release-row { flex-direction:column; }
    .github-links { gap:18px; }
    .requirements-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:27px; }
    .download-details { padding-block:60px; }
    .guide-details li,.guide-details article>p { font-size:13px; }
    .guide-details h3 { font-size:27px; }
    .guide-finish { flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; }
  }
}

@layer motion {
  .motion-paused .usb-scroll-story { height:auto; min-height:0; }
  .motion-paused .usb-sticky { position:relative; height:auto; min-height:600px; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .usb-scroll-story { height:auto; min-height:0; } .usb-sticky { position:relative; height:auto; min-height:600px; } }
}

@layer responsive {
 .motion-paused .usb-scroll-story {height:auto;min-height:0} .motion-paused .usb-sticky {position:relative;height:auto;min-height:600px}
 @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.usb-scroll-story{height:auto;min-height:0}.usb-sticky{position:relative;height:auto;min-height:600px}}
}
</style>
  
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <svg class="svg-definitions" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><defs>
    <symbol id="i-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-diagonal" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-download" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v12m-5-5 5 5 5-5M5 17v4h14v-4"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-camera" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="14" rx="4"/><path d="m8 6 2-3h4l2 3"/><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="4"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-windows" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 4h8v8H3zm10 0h8v8h-8zM3 14h8v7H3zm10 0h8v7h-8z"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-android" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m7 5-2-3m12 3 2-3M3 13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0v7H3z"/><path d="M7 10h.01M17 10h.01" stroke-width="3"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-frame" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 3H3v6m12-6h6v6M3 15v6h6m12-6v6h-6"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-grid" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M9 3v18m6-18v18M3 9h18M3 15h18"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-wifi" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2 8a16 16 0 0 1 20 0M5 12a11 11 0 0 1 14 0M8 16a6 6 0 0 1 8 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="20" r="1"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-cable" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 2v4m4-4v4M6 6h8v3a4 4 0 0 1-8 0zm4 7v4a4 4 0 0 0 8 0v-3m-2 0h4v-4h-4z"/></symbol>
    <symbol id="i-qr" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 3h6v6H3zm12 0h6v6h-6zM3 15h6v6H3zm12 0h2v2h-2zm4 4h2v2h-2zM12 3v2m0 6v2m-9-1h4m4 5v4m4-2v2m4-10h2v4"/></symbol>
  </defs></svg>

  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="PhoneCam Link home"><span class="brand-mark"><svg><use href="#i-camera"/></svg></span>PhoneCam <span class="brand-light">Link</span></a>
    <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#use-cases">Use cases</a><a href="#connection">Connectivity</a><a href="#app-preview">The app</a></nav>
    <div class="nav-actions"><button class="motion-toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Pause motion"><span class="pause-symbol" aria-hidden="true">Ⅱ</span></button><a href="./PhoneCam-Link-Downloads.html" class="button button-small">Get the apps <svg><use href="#i-diagonal"/></svg></a><button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-nav" aria-label="Open menu"><span></span><span></span></button></div>
    <nav id="mobile-nav" class="mobile-nav" aria-label="Mobile navigation" hidden><a href="#use-cases">Use cases</a><a href="#connection">Connectivity</a><a href="#app-preview">The app</a><a href="./PhoneCam-Link-Downloads.html">Downloads</a></nav>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> YOUR CAMERA. A NEW CONNECTION.</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">Small camera.<br><span class="serif">Bigger possibilities.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-description">Google Meet. Zoom. Your next livestream.<br>Your Android camera, connected to Windows 11.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="./PhoneCam-Link-Downloads.html">Get PhoneCam Link <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a><a class="text-link" href="#use-cases">See what it can do <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
      </div>

      <div class="device-stage galaxy-stage" role="img" aria-label="Concept visualization of a Galaxy Book6 Ultra and Galaxy S24 Ultra connected with a USB cable">
        <div class="galaxy-hero-frame"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," width="1400" height="933" alt="" fetchpriority="high"></div>
        <span class="galaxy-model model-phone">Galaxy S24 Ultra <span>ANDROID CAMERA</span></span><span class="galaxy-model model-book">Galaxy Book6 Ultra <span>WINDOWS 11</span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-footnote"><span>ANDROID + WINDOWS</span><span>Samsung device concept visualization</span><a href="#experience" aria-label="Scroll to experience"><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE</span> ↓</a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="use-cases section-shell" id="use-cases" aria-labelledby="use-cases-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow reveal">01 — PUT YOUR CAMERA TO WORK</p><h2 id="use-cases-title" class="reveal">Show up.<br><span class="serif">Stand out.</span></h2></div><p class="body-copy reveal">The camera in your pocket.<br>A place in your everyday setup.</p></div>
      <div class="use-case-grid">
        <article class="use-card reveal"><div class="use-image"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," width="1400" height="933" loading="lazy" alt="Illustrated Samsung laptop and Galaxy phone setup for a video meeting"><span class="image-chip">GOOGLE MEET / ZOOM</span></div><div class="use-card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">VIDEO CALLS</span><h3>A better angle<br>on every conversation.</h3><p>Bring your Android camera to Google Meet and Zoom. Select <strong>PhoneCam Link</strong> as your camera in the meeting app on a compatible Windows 11 PC.</p><a class="text-link" href="#app-preview">Meet your new camera <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div></article>
        <article class="use-card use-dark reveal"><div class="use-image"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," width="1400" height="933" loading="lazy" alt="Illustrated Galaxy phone and Windows laptop setup for a creator’s livestream"><span class="image-chip">LIVE STREAMING / OBS</span></div><div class="use-card-copy"><span class="eyebrow">CONTENT CREATION</span><h3>Your stream.<br>Less extra gear.</h3><p>Use your phone as a camera source in OBS or another compatible streaming app. No separate webcam or capture card needed for the phone’s video feed.</p><a class="text-link" href="#connection">Find your connection <svg><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></a></div></article>
      </div>
      <div class="use-case-strip reveal"><span class="strip-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><div><h3>Teach it. Make it. Show it.</h3><p>Point the phone at your notes, a prototype, or your next creation. Share that camera view through your call or stream.</p></div><span class="use-tag">DEMOS &amp; TUTORIALS</span></div>
      <p class="illustration-note">Use-case images are concept visualizations. App compatibility and camera permissions apply. Select your microphone separately in the call or streaming app.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="app-showcase" id="app-preview" aria-labelledby="app-preview-title"><div class="section-shell">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow reveal">02 — MEET PHONECAM LINK</p><h2 id="app-preview-title" class="reveal">Your camera.<br><span class="serif">Your controls.</span></h2></div><p class="body-copy reveal">Choose a lens. Set the focus.<br>Make the picture yours.</p></div>
      <div class="app-gallery reveal"><figure class="app-desktop"><div class="app-window-chrome"><span>PhoneCam Link · Windows</span><span aria-hidden="true">— &nbsp; □ &nbsp; ×</span></div><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," width="1120" height="690" loading="lazy" alt="Source-based PhoneCam Link Windows interface showing Ready, Connect, Connection, Camera controls, Stream quality and presentation, and Video decoder"><figcaption>WINDOWS 11 · RECEIVE &amp; CONTROL</figcaption></figure><figure class="app-mobile"><span class="app-punch-hole" aria-hidden="true"></span><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," width="420" height="995" loading="lazy" alt="Source-based PhoneCam Link Android interface showing Start camera, Connection transport and Camera controls"><figcaption>ANDROID · CAPTURE</figcaption></figure></div>
      <p class="app-source-note">Reconstructed from the PhoneCam Link 1.1.21 interface source. Blue accents match this website; example lens values are illustrative. These are not captured app screenshots.</p>
      <div class="app-feature-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Lens &amp; focus</h3><p>Discover available lenses. Choose continuous or locked focus, or focus at the centre—from either app.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Quality &amp; orientation</h3><p>HD, FHD and UHD selectors, frame rate, bitrate, orientation and mirroring. Available profiles depend on the phone and lens.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>A Windows camera source</h3><p>PhoneCam Link appears as a selectable virtual camera on Windows 11. Choose it inside your call or streaming application.</p></article></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="intro section-shell" id="experience" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">03 — A FRESH PERSPECTIVE</p>
      <div class="intro-columns"><h2 id="intro-title" class="reveal">Your phone sees it.<br><span class="muted">Your PC brings<br>it into focus.</span></h2><div class="intro-aside reveal"><span class="mini-aperture" aria-hidden="true"></span><p>A camera you can move.<br>A screen with room to see.</p><p class="body-copy">PhoneCam Link brings them together. Position your Android phone where the view is best, and bring its camera feed to your Windows PC.</p></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="cinema" aria-labelledby="cinema-title">
      <div class="cinema-sticky">
        <div class="cinema-image"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" alt="Snow-covered mountain and a blue glacial lake"><div class="cinema-shade"></div></div>
        <div class="cinema-content"><p class="eyebrow">ONE MOMENT. TWO SCREENS.</p><h2 id="cinema-title">See the<br><span class="serif">bigger picture.</span></h2><p>Let your camera go beyond<br>the edge of your phone.</p></div>
        <div class="cinema-reticle" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="cinema-bottom"><span class="cinema-note">Illustrative scene · not a live camera feed</span><span class="cinema-progress" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span><span>PHONE → PC</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lens-section section-shell" id="lenses" aria-labelledby="lens-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow reveal">THE RIGHT LENS FOR THE MOMENT</p><h2 id="lens-title" class="reveal">Go wide.<br><span class="serif">Get closer.</span></h2></div><p class="body-copy reveal">Select the lenses your phone exposes.<br>Control them from your phone or PC.</p></div><div class="lens-showcase reveal"><div class="lens-view"><img id="lens-photo" src="data:image/webp;base64," width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" alt="Illustrative alpine scene used to explore lens framing"><span class="lens-view-label" id="lens-view-label">WIDE · EVERYDAY PERSPECTIVE</span><div class="lens-focus" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="lens-console"><div class="s24-back" aria-label="Illustration of the Galaxy S24 Ultra rear camera array" role="img"><span class="lens-ring lens-ring-one"></span><span class="lens-ring lens-ring-two selected"></span><span class="lens-ring lens-ring-three"></span><span class="lens-ring lens-ring-four"></span><span class="lens-flash"></span><span class="back-wordmark">SAMSUNG</span></div><div class="lens-controls"><p class="eyebrow">CHOOSE A PERSPECTIVE</p><div class="lens-selector" role="group" aria-label="Illustrative lens selection"><button type="button" data-lens="ultra" aria-pressed="false">Ultra wide</button><button type="button" data-lens="wide" aria-pressed="true">Wide</button><button type="button" data-lens="tele" aria-pressed="false">Telephoto</button></div><p id="lens-description" aria-live="polite">An everyday perspective for calls, demos and more.</p></div></div></div><p class="illustration-note">Field-of-view illustration using crops of one image, not samples from different lenses. Available lenses and capture profiles depend on the phone’s Camera2 support.</p></section>

    <section class="comparison-section section-shell" id="comparison" aria-labelledby="comparison-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow reveal">EXPLORE THE CAMERA DIFFERENCE</p><h2 id="comparison-title" class="reveal">A clearer way<br><span class="serif">to show up.</span></h2></div><p class="body-copy reveal">Drag the divider.<br>Imagine a different camera for your calls.</p></div><div class="comparison reveal" style="--split:50%"><img class="compare-sharp" src="data:image/webp;base64," width="1400" height="933" loading="lazy" alt="Sharp alpine landscape for an illustrative camera comparison"><div class="compare-soft"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," width="1400" height="933" loading="lazy" alt="The same alpine landscape with an artificial softness treatment"></div><div class="compare-labels"><span>LAPTOP CAMERA CONCEPT <small>Simulated softness</small></span><span>PHONECAM LINK CONCEPT <small>Original reference image</small></span></div><span class="comparison-handle" aria-hidden="true"><i>↔</i></span><input id="comparison-range" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" aria-label="Camera comparison divider" aria-describedby="comparison-disclosure"><span class="comparison-disclaimer">ILLUSTRATIVE · NOT A CAMERA BENCHMARK</span></div><p id="comparison-disclosure" class="illustration-note">This demo applies artificial blur to one side of the same generated image. It does not measure a Galaxy Book or Galaxy phone camera. Actual quality depends on the devices, lighting and stream settings.</p></section>

    <section class="perspective section-shell" aria-labelledby="perspective-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow reveal">04 — ROOM TO EXPLORE</p><h2 id="perspective-title" class="reveal">Change the frame.<br><span class="serif">Keep the moment.</span></h2></div><p class="body-copy reveal">A little perspective goes a long way.<br>Explore the same scene in a different frame.</p></div>
      <div class="frame-demo reveal">
        <div class="demo-toolbar"><span class="demo-brand"><span class="status-dot"></span> PERSPECTIVE PLAYGROUND</span><div class="demo-tools"><button type="button" class="icon-button" id="grid-toggle" aria-label="Show composition grid" aria-pressed="false"><svg><use href="#i-grid"/></svg></button><button type="button" class="icon-button" id="expand-demo" aria-label="Expand scene"><svg><use href="#i-frame"/></svg></button></div></div>
        <div class="demo-image-shell" id="demo-scene"><div class="demo-crop" data-format="wide"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Interactive alpine scene: change the frame using the buttons below" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"><div class="composition-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div><span class="demo-coordinate" aria-hidden="true">+ &nbsp; FIND YOUR FRAME &nbsp; +</span></div></div>
        <div class="demo-footer"><p>One scene. <span id="format-description" aria-live="polite">A wider perspective.</span></p><div class="format-selector" role="group" aria-label="Scene framing"><button type="button" data-format="wide" aria-pressed="true">Landscape</button><button type="button" data-format="portrait" aria-pressed="false">Portrait</button><button type="button" data-format="flipped" aria-pressed="false">Flipped</button></div></div>
      </div>
      <p class="illustration-note">Interactive website illustration. App controls and available formats may differ by release.</p>
      <div class="benefit-row"><article class="reveal"><span class="benefit-number">01</span><h3>Move your viewpoint.</h3><p>Place your phone where a fixed laptop camera can’t go.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span class="benefit-number">02</span><h3>Give the view some space.</h3><p>Bring the camera feed onto your Windows screen.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span class="benefit-number">03</span><h3>Bring your devices together.</h3><p>A companion app on each side of the connection.</p></article></div>
    </section>

    <section class="connection connectivity-section" id="connection" aria-labelledby="connection-title"><div class="section-shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow reveal">05 — CONNECT YOUR WAY</p><h2 id="connection-title" class="reveal">A cable. A signal.<br><span class="serif">Your choice.</span></h2></div><p class="body-copy reveal">Explore the connection modes.<br>See what is in the app—and what is next.</p></div><div class="connection-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Connection methods"><button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-wifi" aria-controls="panel-wifi" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-wifi"/></svg><span>Wi-Fi</span></button>
<button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-usb-adb" aria-controls="panel-usb-adb" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-cable"/></svg><span>USB · ADB</span></button>
<button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-wifi-direct" aria-controls="panel-wifi-direct" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-wifi"/></svg><span>Wi-Fi Direct</span></button>
<button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-usb-accessory" aria-controls="panel-usb-accessory" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-cable"/></svg><span>USB accessory</span><small>PLANNED</small></button></div><div class="connection-panels"><section class="connection-panel" id="panel-wifi" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-wifi" tabindex="0"  data-visual="wireless" data-auto-open="false">
    <div class="connection-story"><span class="feature-status implemented">In the app</span><p class="eyebrow">SAME NETWORK. MORE FREEDOM.</p><h3>Find your angle. Lose the cable.</h3><p>Connect your phone and PC to the same Wi-Fi network. PhoneCam Link discovers the camera so you can place it where the shot works best.</p><ol class="connection-steps"><li>Join the same Wi-Fi</li><li>Start camera on Android</li><li>Connect on Windows</li></ol><p class="connection-note">Automatic LAN discovery is included. A manual phone address is available if your network blocks discovery.</p></div>
    <div class="transport-visual" role="img" aria-label="Illustrated wireless connection between Galaxy S24 Ultra and Galaxy Book6 Ultra">
      <div class="transport-grid"></div><div class="wifi-router"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-wifi"/></svg><span>SHARED WI-FI</span></div>
      <div class="transport-phone"><span class="transport-hole"></span><div class="transport-phone-screen"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="" width="420" height="850" loading="lazy"></div><div class="phone-sleep"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-camera"/></svg><span>Connect to begin</span></div><span class="transport-label">Galaxy S24 Ultra</span><span class="device-wifi"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-wifi"/></svg></span></div>
      <svg class="transport-path" viewBox="0 0 600 360" aria-hidden="true"><path class="wireless-route" d="M116 120 Q285 -5 459 120"/><path class="cable-route" d="M112 259 V306 Q112 330 150 330 H430 Q467 330 467 297 V245"/><path class="cable-pulse" d="M112 259 V306 Q112 330 150 330 H430 Q467 330 467 297 V245"/><rect class="usb-plug" x="104" y="253" width="16" height="25" rx="3"/></svg>
      <div class="transport-laptop"><span class="transport-webcam"></span><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="" width="1120" height="690" loading="lazy"><span class="transport-bezel">SAMSUNG</span><span class="transport-label">Galaxy Book6 Ultra</span><span class="device-wifi"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-wifi"/></svg></span></div>
      <span class="transport-caption">WIRELESS CAMERA CONNECTION</span>
    </div>
  </section>
<section class="connection-panel" id="panel-usb-adb" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-usb-adb" tabindex="0" hidden data-visual="cable" data-auto-open="false">
    <div class="connection-story"><span class="feature-status implemented">In the app</span><p class="eyebrow">A DIRECT LINE TO YOUR CAMERA.</p><h3>Plug in. Take your place.</h3><p>Connect a USB data cable and bring the camera feed to your PC. ADB port forwarding is handled by the Windows app.</p><ol class="connection-steps"><li>Connect the USB cable</li><li>Approve USB debugging</li><li>Start camera, then Connect</li></ol><p class="connection-note">This mode requires Android Developer options, USB debugging and your approval of the PC. Connecting a cable alone does not start the current app.</p></div>
    <div class="transport-visual" role="img" aria-label="Illustrated cable connection between Galaxy S24 Ultra and Galaxy Book6 Ultra">
