<section class="connection-panel" id="panel-wifi-direct" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-wifi-direct" tabindex="0" hidden data-visual="direct" data-auto-open="false">
    <div class="connection-story"><span class="feature-status implemented">In the app</span><p class="eyebrow">YOUR DEVICES. THEIR OWN CONNECTION.</p><h3>A link without the router.</h3><p>Create a direct Wi-Fi group on your PC and scan its QR code with your phone. A phone-hosted group is also available for compatible adapters.</p><ol class="connection-steps"><li>Create a group on the PC</li><li>Scan the PC’s Wi-Fi QR</li><li>Start and connect the camera</li></ol><p class="connection-note">Requires compatible Wi-Fi hardware. Internet availability depends on your network setup; see release notes for adapter requirements.</p></div>
